OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are councils rebelling over
OL,4,Aplanning rules?
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpposition is growing among councils in
OL,7,FBedfordshire and Hertfordshire to new
OL,8,Frules on who decides planning
OL,9,Fapplications.
OL,11,FThe government says planning officers,
OL,12,Frather than councillors, should decide
OL,13,Fmost applications unless exemptions
OL,14,Fapply.
OL,16,FOne council has refused to change its
OL,17,Fconstitution to reflect the changes,
OL,18,Fsaying they are undemocratic. The
OL,19,Fgovernment insists the move will
OL,20,Fimprove clarity and efficiency.
OL,22,FSo what are these changes all about?
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
